id: API-010
title: OpenAPI spec missing security schemes
category: security
severity: warning
engine: absence
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml .json
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: openapi
patterns:
  - regex: securitySchemes|securityDefinitions
    message: "OpenAPI spec without security schemes — API has no authentication defined"
fix: Add securitySchemes under components (OpenAPI 3) or securityDefinitions (Swagger 2) to define authentication methods.
